    //   (1) every card click is bound to the place_id captured when that card
    //       was rendered (see clui45InstallCardGuards) — a stale node can never
    //       open "its" spot after a re-render;
    //   (2) for CLUI45_TRANSITION_LOCK_MS after a date/tier/region switch the
