    // ---- CL-UI-34: user-visible data provenance (weather modal, deep layer) ----
    // A collapsed <details> at the modal bottom; the cards stay untouched
    // (density principle). Provisional thresholds are stated in user language
    // and never as internal enum names. Cycle times come from the WeatherGrid
